# Hosting and database

- Production is Hostinger at https://giftingstore.online. Do not treat Vercel as the deploy target.
- Company portals are `https://{portal_slug}.giftingstore.online`. `ROOT_DOMAIN=giftingstore.online` belongs in the Hostinger env, with wildcard DNS and the domain `*.giftingstore.online` on that host.
- This app's Supabase project is `ajysowosgjaipczrwpfv` (`corporate-gifting-crm`, ap-south-1) in org `smoddqkpbnbvcqjujvmu`. Ignore `robust-gifting-crm` and `vilms-saas-local-dev` on the same account.
- Run schema changes and SQL with the Supabase MCP (`plugin-supabase-supabase`: `list_projects`, `apply_migration`, `execute_sql`). Do not ask the user to paste or run SQL.
- The MCP is often signed into another account (projects such as `meerav` or `vtech-facades`). If `ajysowosgjaipczrwpfv` is missing from `list_projects`, call `mcp_auth` and have the user sign into the account that owns that project before applying migrations.
